{"server":"en","storyId":"main_4_level_main_04-05_end","groupId":"main_4","stageId":"main_04-05","title":"Bureaucracy","storyCode":"4-5","avgTag":"After Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-05_end.txt","sourceHash":"cd122a81b6ae9eb6d753f8f4df012588c43a68f593f8b3fc0837b053f70037c6","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"Ch'en finally stops being stubborn and agrees to cooperate with Rhodes Island.\nAfter communicating with Kal'tsit, Amiya decides to rescue Meteorite's team.","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三十二关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_m"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"At this point... we're out of other options. Madam Ch'en, if you deny my request..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Rhodes Island will act alone."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"These actions don't violate any of the terms of our cooperation."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Of course we'll be there."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...Is that so..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"In that case, thank you on behalf of Rhodes Island..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I know that Lungmen still sees us as Infected..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"It's not a big deal."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"However, I'm not sure if our squads will be able to make it into the ruins."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"We'll have to play it by ear."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"If the situation allows, we will definitely help."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"However, our top priority is still to eliminate Reunion."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"That... that's enough for us."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...Thank you, Madam Ch'en."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Sorry, I have my own duties."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Did you hear me, Doc?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"We will join up with Rhodes Island."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya, be careful."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"This won't be a simple task."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I will."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Right, I've managed to put together some pieces of intel."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Rhodes Island has already deployed rescue squads to assist the other recon squads."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"But Meteorite's squad is too far and we cannot reach them."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"This is where you come in."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Only Meteorite's squad..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I understand. I'll go look for them."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"I'll send you the coordinates later."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Remember, safety is your top priority."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Understood."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"So, when are we heading out?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Right now."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"I'll go get ready. Notify the other L.G.D. members."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"All right."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya, we'll leave from here in ten minutes."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Okay."},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Please be safe..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["Amiya"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["Ch'en"]},{"speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","aliases":["Hoshiguma"]}]}
